{"sourceUrl":"https://cqb.pku.edu.cn/info/1064/3040.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:51.621951+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cqb.pku.edu.cn/info/1064/3040.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div><p><span><span>北京大学定量生物学中心</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年夏令营活动将于</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>-4</span><span><span>日举行，申请工作从</span></span><span><span>即日</span></span><span><span>起开始，具体活动安排另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>北京大学定量生物学中心</span></span><span>(</span><span><span>原北大理论生物中心</span></span><span>)</span><span> </span><span><span>是在李政道先生的提议和北京大学的大力支持下，于</span></span><span>2001</span><span><span>年成立，</span></span><span>2006</span><span><span>年成为前沿交叉学科研究院首批正式成员单位。中心的宗旨是利用北京大学的多学科优势，促进数、理、化、工、信息等定量学科与生命科学的交叉融合，寻找复杂生物系统中的定量规律，成为该前沿领域的科研与人才培养的国际中心。</span></span></p><p><span><span>中心主要围绕以下方向开展研究：生命系统中的复杂性原理和规律；系统生物学；合成生物学；计算生物学；物理生物学；人工智能与生物系统；定量生物学技术；单分子生物物理；生物信息学；复杂疾病网络与药物设计等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>中心有来自不同学科背景的强大而充满活力的师资队伍，包括中国科学院院士、讲席教授、杰青和优青等。中心成员分布于前沿交叉学科研究院、物理学院、化学学院、生命学院、数学学院、未来技术学院和麦戈文脑研究所等，开展广泛密切的合作，推动定量学科与生命科学的交叉融合。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、申请资格</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span><span>、申请者须是全国高校</span></span><span>2026</span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>、思想道德品质良好，遵纪守法；</span></span><span> </span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>、学习成绩优秀，英语水平良好；</span></span><span> </span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>、生物学、物理、数学、化学、医学、计算机科学、材料、电子等相关理工科专业背景，对交叉学科领域有浓厚的兴趣，有志于从事学术研究工作。</span></span><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>备注：</span></span></strong><span><span>已退出</span><span>“强基计划”的北京大学学生及其它学校“强基计划”（含退出）学生请勿报名。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>下载地址：</span></span><a href=\"http://www.aais.pku.edu.cn/tongzhi/shownews.php?lang=cn&amp;id=1860\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.aais.pku.edu.cn/tongzhi/shownews.php?lang=cn&amp;id=1860</span></a></p><p><span>1</span><span><span>、北京大学前沿交叉学科研究院</span></span><span>2025</span><span><span>年夏令营申请表</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（北大模板中填写，见附件一）</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>、个人陈述（关于个人学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作以及未来学习和研究的计划、目标等）</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（北大模板中填写，见附件二）</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span><span>、专家推荐信</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>封，专家须为所报学科专业领域内的副教授（含）以上或具有相当专业技术职称。推荐信须由专家亲笔签字，且密封并在封口骑缝处签字（北大模板中填写，见附件三）</span></span></p><p><span>4</span><span><span>、应届本科生需提供前两年半本科阶段成绩单（由教务部门盖章）</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份，前两年半总评成绩排名证明（由教务部门盖章）</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>份（北大模板中填写，见附件四）</span></span></p><p><span>5</span><span><span>、体现自身英语水平的证明，如国家英语四、六级考试、或</span></span><span>TOEFL</span><span><span>、雅思与</span></span><span>GRE</span><span><span>考试等成绩的复印件</span></span></p><p><span>6</span><span><span>、应届本科毕业生提交所在学校在学证明</span></span></p><p><span>7</span><span><span>、其他证明材料（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果的</span></span><span><span>首页</span></span><span><span>复印件、获奖证书复印件等）</span></span></p><p><span>8</span><span><span>、承诺书（附件五）</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者应保证提交的所有信息及材料真实、有效、完整，如因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担</span></span></p><p><span><span>请申请人保留申请材料原件或副本，申请材料提交后一律不予返还。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>备注：</span></span></strong><span><span>申请表中的</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>申请专业</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>请查看夏令营报名系统中具体信息。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、提交申请</span></span></strong></p><p><span>1<span>、</span></span><span><span>网上报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人登录网址</span></span><span>http://aaissummer.pku.edu.cn</span><span><span>，注册并填写夏令营报名申请表，网上报名系统从即日起开放，网上申报截止时间为</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>12</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>16:00</span><span><span>。注意所有纸版申请材料信息必须与网报信息完全一致，否则视为材料作假。</span></span><span><span>定量生物学中心实行导师轮转制度，在系统中填写夏令营报名信息时不需要选导师。</span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>、材料提交</span></span><span><br/></span><span>       1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>电子版材料：</span></span><span><span>请将所有申请材料（除推荐信外）按照以上顺序合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>附件在报名系统上传，命名为“姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span><span>+</span><span>定量生物学中心”；</span></span></p><p><span><span>专家推荐信上传方式为：学生本人在网报系统中填写完成所有报名信息并点击</span><span>“保存”后，请点击推荐专家电子邮箱右侧的“发送邮件”按钮，推荐专家的相应邮箱会收到系统自动发送的推荐信上传链接，推荐专家本人点击链接上传专家推荐信后，学生的报名系统会显示“已上传推荐信”。三封专家推荐信全部上传完成后，可以点击“提交”按钮进行报名材料提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span>2</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>纸质版材料：</span></span><span><span>请将上述申请材料按顺序整理后一并装入</span></span><span>A4</span><span><span>大信封，并</span></span><span><span>在信封醒目位置注明</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>定量生物学中心</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。请将邮寄材料按顺序整理后以</span></span><span>EMS</span><span><span>快递方式邮寄至</span></span><span> (</span><span><span>北大学生可直接送交至</span></span><span>)</span><span> </span><span><span>如下地址：</span></span></p><p><span><span>地</span></span><span>    </span><span><span>址：北京市海淀区颐和园路</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>号北京大学老化学楼东配楼</span></span><span>301-3</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>100871</span></p><p><span><span>收件人：姜老师（定量生物学中心招生）</span></span></p><p><span><span>电</span></span><span>    </span><span><span>话：</span></span><span>010-62759595</span></p><p><span><span>纸质材料接收的截止时间为</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>13</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>16:00</span><span><span>（以申请材料到达日期为准）</span></span><span><span>，过期不再接受申请。材料邮寄只接收</span></span><span>EMS</span><span><span>快递方式</span></span><span><span>，如使用其他快递公司邮寄产生材料无法正常寄达等不良情况，后果自负。</span></span></p><p><span> 3</span><span><span>、所有网报上传信息要与上交纸质申请材料信息完全一致，如发现不一致将取消夏令营资格。只在网上报名而未邮寄纸质材料者，或只邮寄纸质材料而未进行网上报名者，以其他方式申请报名者，其申请不予受理。申请人可通过查看个人注册邮箱或登陆网址</span></span><span>http://aaissummer.pku.edu.cn</span><span><span>查询纸质材料收寄状态、材料审核状态与结果等信息（具体流程可查看夏令营网上报名系统操作指南），材料审核期间不接受电话或邮件询问进展情况。</span></span><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>定量生物学中心</span></span></p><p><span><span>姜老师</span></span><span>,</span><span> </span><span><span>电话</span></span><span>: 010-62759595, Email: </span><a href=\"mailto:jpping@pku.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>jpping@pku.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><span><span>李老师</span></span><span>,</span><span> </span><span><span>电话</span></span><span>: 010-62759599, Email: </span><a href=\"https://mail.pku.edu.cn/coremail/XT3/pab/view.jsp?sid=BAnGnsTTAChHuikjzhTTHtRZZpPvWIJh&amp;totalCount=14&amp;view_no=5&amp;puid=2581&amp;gid=11\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>cmlee@pku.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><span><span>前沿交叉学科研究院</span></span></p><p><span><span>政策咨询：赵老师，电话：</span></span><span>010-62760228</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>Email</span><span><span>：</span></span><span>ryzhao@pku.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><span>报名网页系统疑问：王老师，电话：</span></span><span>13311014028</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>  Email:wanghuaxtx@163.com </span></p><p><span><span>五、相关链接：</span></span></p><p><span><span>定量生物学中心网站</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://cqb.pku.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://cqb.pku.edu.cn</span></a><span>/</span></p><p><span><span>前沿交叉学科研究院</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.aais.pku.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://www.aais.pku.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><span><span>报名二维码：</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cqb.pku.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=tLmGjaM7V2MRCsUwN-DMR-PolC8UNVXfLlM7nR-8nm94Mml0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8n1ybLYybnN7Ynzn2LlQkUllsU8UZM4UsMm7aMR-iozTFL7UDnmWkLmMFL4rfL1baptveo4OeCsV1gDTJQty0LzGDMky4LRUagtA8pU/cc&amp;oid=1838437936&amp;tid=1064&amp;nid=3040&amp;e=.png\"/><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>更多信息请关注定量生物学中心微信公众号：</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cqb.pku.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=toRrjVM47PMzWkowlUPM7WknmQ2LRlXYMmCbUm9aMmr7M8l0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8MkyPUYyZMzfVMz74UNCaUN7aozVRLmlbU4-8LRvZUlnFLm9iM7lanlQFM4N4LYbaptveo4OeCsV1gDTJQty0LzGDMky4LRUagtA8pU/cc&amp;oid=1838437936&amp;tid=1064&amp;nid=3040&amp;e=.png\"/><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p></div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"f06a25d83a5f4ad946cfa9569e1e1d89d9751fdd01df13e6013efa35ca3e7a9e","textLength":2352,"sourceSha256":"930e2f997ffae7b2ada894ed4b801c3536b8dfceccd0a1f6c006ec2e7b4d7f73","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-31a591b2eb51cac4dd7f","title":"2025年北京大学定量生物学中心优秀大学生夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:51.621951+00:00"}
